      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do you mean tast tests? None of the unit tests broke.\nSo this particular set of logs is an issue because there are quite a chunk of them and they all get printed within an ISR, so this is actually locking up the EC while they are being printed.\nI ack that there are wider issues and fixes to be had, though my immediate concern is fixing issues impacting craask etc.",
