      "writtenOn": "2023-01-16T04:54:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Setting `CC_DEFAULT` to exclude `CC_DPTF` seems like a good option, though it doesn\u0027t currently seem possible to configure that in a zephyr build.\n\nWhat if we added a default-off option to drop logs from ISR rather than printk them? That would fix the immediate problem of printk-for-logging, and could later be adjusted to help prevent accidental misuse in the future (perhaps by making it panic in debug builds instead of doing nothing).",
      "parentUuid": "25b6bfd2_3e27eae9",
      "revId": "79f636521d5831ff6103e637c018fc848000de0f",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
